  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39499494",
      "title": "Using the Query Key As Query Function Input",
      "sourceHash": "225200c6a73f9330b25c9460b42082dfd8266b9b132b8f6d43e2545649f24726",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 3.9,
          "en": "So at this point we're pretty much done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.9,
          "end": 6.93,
          "en": "with this demo application here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.93,
          "end": 9.06,
          "en": "but there are two remaining things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.06,
          "end": 12.27,
          "en": "I still wanna tackle in this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.27,
          "end": 15.9,
          "en": "And the first thing is that here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.9,
          "end": 18.36,
          "en": "under recently added events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.36,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "we are currently always showing all events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 24.78,
          "en": "which doesn't make a lot of sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.78,
          "end": 28.653,
          "en": "It would be better if we would only see some events here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.67,
          "end": 31.14,
          "en": "And to achieve this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.14,
          "end": 35.22,
          "en": "we can go to the NewEventsSection JSX file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.22,
          "end": 38.61,
          "en": "where we got this NewEventsSection component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.61,
          "end": 41.52,
          "en": "And here we can tweak that query",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.52,
          "end": 44.97,
          "en": "such that it does not fetch all events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.97,
          "end": 47.88,
          "en": "but instead just some events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.88,
          "end": 51.93,
          "en": "just the first three events, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.93,
          "end": 56.58,
          "en": "And indeed my backend code supports this feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.58,
          "end": 61.58,
          "en": "In that backend code, in that route that delivers events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.01,
          "end": 66.51,
          "en": "I'm looking for a max query parameter in the URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.51,
          "end": 69.96000000000001,
          "en": "and if that max query parameter is set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.96000000000001,
          "end": 73.56,
          "en": "I'm fetching this maximum amount of items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.56,
          "end": 76.38,
          "en": "from the end of the array of events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.38,
          "end": 79.173,
          "en": "that is stored on this backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.46000000000001,
          "end": 83.78999999999999,
          "en": "So we must set such a max query parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.78999999999999,
          "end": 88.41,
          "en": "on that outgoing URL to limit the number of items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.41,
          "end": 92.46000000000001,
          "en": "we're retrieving and to get the most recent items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 92.46000000000001,
          "end": 96.33,
          "en": "Therefore, in the frontend http.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 96.33,
          "end": 100.8,
          "en": "we have to tweak this fetchEvents function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 100.8,
          "end": 102.81,
          "en": "just as we tweaked it before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 102.81,
          "end": 106.22999999999999,
          "en": "to include the search functionality.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 106.22999999999999,
          "end": 108.57,
          "en": "Now here in fetchEvents,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 108.57,
          "end": 111.87,
          "en": "besides looking for a searchTerm property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 111.87,
          "end": 113.37,
          "en": "that might be set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.37,
          "end": 118.37,
          "en": "I also wanna pull out a max property from this object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 118.89,
          "end": 121.263,
          "en": "And this name of course is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 122.22,
          "end": 126.18,
          "en": "Now with that, I then want to tweak the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 126.18,
          "end": 129.9,
          "en": "depending on whether max and searchTerm are set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 129.9,
          "end": 132.483,
          "en": "or just one of the two or none of them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 133.59,
          "end": 135.06,
          "en": "Now if none of them is set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.06,
          "end": 138.543,
          "en": "this should be the entire URL that's being used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 139.5,
          "end": 142.05,
          "en": "If searchTerm should be available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 142.05,
          "end": 146.88,
          "en": "This is what I want to have, though not quite actually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.88,
          "end": 148.65,
          "en": "Instead, I first want to check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 148.65,
          "end": 152.64,
          "en": "if searchTerm and max are being set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.64,
          "end": 156.24,
          "en": "So if both query parameters exist,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 156.24,
          "end": 157.92000000000002,
          "en": "because if that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.92000000000002,
          "end": 162.75,
          "en": "I wanna append both query parameters to the URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 162.75,
          "end": 165.81,
          "en": "which can be done by then adding a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 165.81,
          "end": 170.81,
          "en": "where I first add search and set this equal to searchTerm,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 171,
          "end": 172.953,
          "en": "just as I'm doing it down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 174.24,
          "end": 179.073,
          "en": "But I then also add a second query parameter, max,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 179.91,
          "end": 184.413,
          "en": "which I set equal to this max value I'm getting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 185.79,
          "end": 189.21,
          "en": "And this equal sign actually has to go here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 189.21,
          "end": 190.773,
          "en": "And here we need a plus.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 191.82,
          "end": 194.94,
          "en": "So that here I'm concatenating a long string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 194.94,
          "end": 199.38,
          "en": "that includes both search parameters, both query parameters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 199.38,
          "end": 202.26,
          "en": "if we're getting these two properties here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 202.26,
          "end": 203.853,
          "en": "in this fetchEvents function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 205.53,
          "end": 207.51,
          "en": "Now if this should not be the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 207.51,
          "end": 209.94,
          "en": "if just one of them should be set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 209.94,
          "end": 213.12,
          "en": "I want to check those different cases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 213.12,
          "end": 216.45,
          "en": "So else if we don't have both being set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 216.45,
          "end": 218.37,
          "en": "but we have the searchTerm,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 218.37,
          "end": 220.713,
          "en": "I want to tweak the URL like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 221.91,
          "end": 225.39,
          "en": "and else if max is set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 225.39,
          "end": 230.39,
          "en": "the URL should be tweaked to include just max.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 230.4,
          "end": 235.233,
          "en": "So ?max equals max, this maximum property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 236.4,
          "end": 240.33,
          "en": "And with that we're handling all these different scenarios",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 240.33,
          "end": 242.37,
          "en": "and we now just have to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 242.37,
          "end": 244.68,
          "en": "that in the new events section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 244.68,
          "end": 248.193,
          "en": "we do actually set this max property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 249.75,
          "end": 251.79,
          "en": "So fetchEvents should be wrapped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 251.79,
          "end": 253.74,
          "en": "in an anonymous function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 253.74,
          "end": 257.133,
          "en": "so that we can control how it will be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 258.18,
          "end": 260.73,
          "en": "And we should pull out that signal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 260.73,
          "end": 262.71,
          "en": "which we're getting from React Query",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 262.71,
          "end": 264.81,
          "en": "here in this argument list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 264.81,
          "end": 267.51,
          "en": "and forward it through that object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 267.51,
          "end": 270.33299999999997,
          "en": "which we pass through fetchEvents to fetchEvents.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 271.35,
          "end": 272.97,
          "en": "But then here, in addition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 272.97,
          "end": 276.87,
          "en": "I also wanna set max to 3, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 276.87,
          "end": 279.963,
          "en": "if I want to have the latest three events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 281.22,
          "end": 284.49,
          "en": "But now we should of course also update the queryKey.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 284.49,
          "end": 286.92,
          "en": "For example, by passing an object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 286.92,
          "end": 290.1,
          "en": "where we also say max 3,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 290.1,
          "end": 293.493,
          "en": "so that we have a dedicated queryKey for this query.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 294.33,
          "end": 297.27,
          "en": "And that's of course kind of the same thing we did",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 297.27,
          "end": 300.99,
          "en": "in the FindEventSection before with the searchTerm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 300.99,
          "end": 304.683,
          "en": "There I also included the searchTerm in the queryKey.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 305.97,
          "end": 309.03,
          "en": "But we can now also use an alternative approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 309.03,
          "end": 312.48,
          "en": "which we could have also used here for the searchTerm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 312.48,
          "end": 315.99,
          "en": "Because if you take a closer look at this code, you can see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 315.99,
          "end": 319.65,
          "en": "that we're passing the same information here essentially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 319.65,
          "end": 323.22,
          "en": "to the queryKey and also to fetchEvents.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 323.22,
          "end": 325.8,
          "en": "And that's of course kind of redundant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 325.8,
          "end": 329.64,
          "en": "especially since you also might recall that in this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 329.64,
          "end": 331.95,
          "en": "which we're getting from React Query",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 331.95,
          "end": 334.26,
          "en": "passed into this query function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 334.26,
          "end": 338.01,
          "en": "we also get the queryKey that is responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 338.01,
          "end": 340.413,
          "en": "for triggering this function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 341.7,
          "end": 345.09000000000003,
          "en": "So we get this queryKey as an input here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 345.09000000000003,
          "end": 347.28,
          "en": "and therefore it is actually enough",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 347.28,
          "end": 350.31,
          "en": "to provide this information here once",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 350.31,
          "end": 352.203,
          "en": "and then reuse it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 353.22,
          "end": 355.86,
          "en": "So in order to pass this information along",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 355.86,
          "end": 358.14,
          "en": "with the signal to fetchEvents,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 358.14,
          "end": 360.66,
          "en": "we can simply use the spread operator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 360.66,
          "end": 365.64,
          "en": "that's built into JavaScript and spread this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 365.64,
          "end": 370.26,
          "en": "which is the second element in our queryKey here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 370.26,
          "end": 372.513,
          "en": "by using queryKey 1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 373.65,
          "end": 378.65,
          "en": "1 to access this second element here in the array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 379.2,
          "end": 380.52,
          "en": "and then the spread operator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 380.52,
          "end": 383.79,
          "en": "to basically copy this object with its properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 383.79,
          "end": 385.563,
          "en": "into this object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 386.52,
          "end": 390.055,
          "en": "And this simply allows us to avoid some copy and pasting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 390.055,
          "end": 391.83299999999997,
          "en": "and repetition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 392.79,
          "end": 395.1,
          "en": "And of course we could have used the same approach here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 395.1,
          "end": 396.6,
          "en": "for the searchTerm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 396.6,
          "end": 400.83,
          "en": "We also could have named this year searchTerm, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 400.83,
          "end": 404.49,
          "en": "so that we have the same property name as we expected here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 404.49,
          "end": 407.35,
          "en": "And we could have also accepted the queryKey here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 408.72,
          "end": 411.57,
          "en": "and then passed this with the spread operator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 411.57,
          "end": 416.19,
          "en": "into this object with queryKey 1, just as I did it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 416.19,
          "end": 418.953,
          "en": "in the new events section component a second ago.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 420.27,
          "end": 424.77,
          "en": "And if I do that in both components here and I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 424.77,
          "end": 428.31,
          "en": "you see that now we just got three elements here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 428.31,
          "end": 430.74,
          "en": "instead of all four elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 430.74,
          "end": 434.43,
          "en": "So we are just fetching the latest three elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 434.43,
          "end": 438.66,
          "en": "so the three most recently added elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 438.66,
          "end": 441.82,
          "en": "And if I search here, that also still works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 443.1,
          "end": 444.33,
          "en": "as you can see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 444.33,
          "end": 447.21,
          "en": "And here I'm getting all four then in the search case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 447.21,
          "end": 450.24,
          "en": "because here I did not set the max property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 450.24,
          "end": 454.14,
          "en": "Here in this section, I'm just getting three.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
